
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Liquid Glass Experience</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
    "SF Pro Display", sans-serif;
  color: white;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, #6555d9, transparent 40%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, #087eae, transparent 40%),
    linear-gradient(135deg, #101426, #171d38);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.glass {
  background: linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    rgba(255,255,255,.25),
    rgba(255,255,255,.06)
  );
  backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(180%);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(180%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
  box-shadow:
    0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.25),
    inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.5);
  border-radius: 28px;
}

.container {
  width: min(90%, 420px);
  padding: 35px;
  text-align: center;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 35px;
  letter-spacing: -1.5px;
}

p {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.75);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.button {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 20px;
  padding: 15px 28px;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 50px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.17);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,.4);
  transition: .3s ease;
}

.button:hover {
  transform: scale(1.06);
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.3);
  box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,.2);
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<main class="container glass">
  <h1>Liquid Glass</h1>
  <p>
    Découvrez une nouvelle expérience visuelle.
    Transparence, lumière et profondeur,
    inspirées du design Apple.
  </p>

  <a href="#" class="button">Découvrir</a>
</main>

</body>
</html>
